Context: 4. Deputation (Duty) Allowance

The option once exercised shall be final. However, the employees may revise the option under the following circumstances which will be effective  
from the date of occurrence of the same:-  
- (a) when he receives pro forma promotion or is appointed to Non-Functional Selection Grade in his parent cadre;
- (b)
- when he is reverted to a lower grade in parent cadre;
- when the scale of pay of the parent post is revised either
- (c) prospectively or from a retrospective date;
